# PH1000 reference docs + BMS progress — consolidated under site/ph1000 but kept LOCAL-ONLY.
# Gitignored so they are NEVER committed/published by GitHub Pages (BMS_PROGRESS.md holds live
# secrets; the rest are large manufacturer binaries). index.html + README*.md stay tracked.
site/ph1000/BMS_PROGRESS.md
site/ph1000/*.docx
site/ph1000/*.pdf
site/ph1000/*.xlsx

